        "question_title": "For which value of \\(k\\) does the system \\(2x+3y=7,\\ 4x+ky=14\\) have infinitely many solutions?",
        "question_instruction": "Choose one correct option.",
        "explanation": "For infinitely many solutions, \\(4x+ky=14\\) must be twice \\(2x+3y=7\\). Hence \\(k=6\\).",
