        "explanation": "The interior region satisfies \\(y>x+1,\\ y<3-x,\\ y>-2x\\). Substituting \\(y=a^2\\) gives \\(a^2>a+1,\\ a^2<3-a,\\ a^2>-2a\\). Their intersection is \\(\\left(\\frac{-1-\\sqrt{13}}{2},-2\\right)\\).",
