        "question_instruction": "Choose one correct option.",
        "explanation": "Using \\(x=15-y-z\\), the second equation gives \\(y+3z=25\\), and \\(x=2z-10\\). Positivity requires \\(6\\le z\\le 8\\), so \\(z=6,7,8\\), yielding \\(3\\) ordered triples.",
